tle":"Secretary of State for Health and Social Care","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/ministers/secretary-of-state-for-health-and-social-care","withdrawn":false},{"api_path":"/api/content/government/ministers/secretary-of-state-for-the-home-department","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/ministers/secretary-of-state-for-the-home-department","base_path":"/government/ministers/secretary-of-state-for-the-home-department","content_id":"845e5d77-c0f1-11e4-8223-005056011aef","details":{"body":"<p>The Secretary of State has overall responsibility for all Home Office business, including:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>overarching responsibility for the departmental portfolio</li>\n  <li>oversight of the ministerial team</li>\n  <li>Home Office business in Cabinet</li>\n  <li>membership of the National Security Council (NSC)</li>\n  <li>responsibility for public appointments relating to the work of the department</li>\n  <li>oversight of the Security Service</li>\n</ul>\n","role_payment_type":null,"seniority":9,"whip_organisation":{}},"document_type":"ministerial_role","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2025-09-15T11:48:27Z","schema_name":"role","title":"Secretary of State for the Home Department","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/ministers/secretary-of-state-for-the-home-department","withdrawn":false},{"api_path":"/api/content/government/ministers/secretary-of-state-for-foreign-commonwealth-and-development-affairs","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/ministers/secretary-of-state-for-foreign-commonwealth-and-development-affairs","base_path":"/government/ministers/secretary-of-state-for-foreign-commonwealth-and-development-affairs","content_id":"6cdc189e-191e-4cab-bcc1-350478e77c78","details":{"body":"<p>The Secretary of State has overarching responsibility for FCDO and the Ministerial team, and the strategy and delivery of HMG international priorities, including:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>\n    <p>intelligence policy  </p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>National Security Council engagement</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>honours  </p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>EU strategy</p>\n  </li>\n</ul>\n","role_payment_type":null,"seniority":9,"whip_organisation":{}},"document_type":"ministerial_role","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-07-31T11:39:31Z","schema_name":"role","title":"Secretary of State for Foreign, Commonwealth and Development Affairs","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/ministers/secretary-of-state-for-foreign-commonwealth-and-development-affairs","withdrawn":false},{"api_path":"/api/content/government/ministers/secretary-of-state-for-education","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/ministers/secretary-of-state-for-education","base_path":"/government/ministers/secretary-of-state-for-education","content_id":"845e63b4-c0f1-11e4-8223-005056011aef","details":{"body":"<p>The Secretary of State is responsible for the work of the Department for Education, including:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>early years and childcare</li>\n  <li>children’s social care</li>\n  <li>teacher quality, recruitment and retention</li>\n  <li>the school curriculum</li>\n  <li>school improvement</li>\n  <li>academies and free schools</li>\n  <li>further education</li>\n  <li>apprenticeships and skills</li>\n  <li>higher education</li>\n</ul>\n\n","role_payment_type":null,"seniority":16,"whip_organisation":{}},"document_type":"ministerial_role","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2022-11-08T09:31:05Z","schema_name":"role","title":"Secretary of State for Education","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/ministers/secretary-of-state-for-education","withdrawn":false}],"taxons":[{"api_path":"/api/content/international/peace-stability-in-me-and-north-africa","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/international/peace-stability-in-me-and-north-africa","base_path":"/international/peace-stability-in-me-and-north-africa","content_id":"e484667a-d31c-471e-9af5-74f6523d183d","details":{"internal_name":"P